            <li class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 before:content-['—_'] before:text-accent before:font-semibold">Remix each raw video into 2&ndash;3 hook variants before testing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-[20px] tracking-[-0.01em] mt-8 mb-3">How volume testing works with whitelabel UGC</h3>
        <ol class="list-none p-0 counter-reset-step space-y-0">
          <li class="py-3.5 pl-[52px] relative border-b border-border text-ink-2 guide-step"><strong>Order a batch.</strong> Commission 10&ndash;20 whitelabel UGC videos from multiple creators. Vary the ad types (testimonial, demo, before/after), hooks, and creator demographics. Total production cost: $1,500&ndash;$5,000 for the batch.</li>
          <li class="py-3.5 pl-[52px] relative border-b border-border text-ink-2 guide-step"><strong>Remix for variants.</strong> The brand's media team takes each raw video and creates 2&ndash;3 variants: different hooks spliced onto the same body, different captions, different CTA text. 10 raw videos become 20&ndash;30 testable ad variants.</li>
          <li class="py-3.5 pl-[52px] relative border-b border-border text-ink-2 guide-step"><strong>Test with small budgets.</strong> Launch all variants with $50&ndash;$100 per variant in ad spend. Run for 48&ndash;72 hours. This is enough data to identify winners and losers.</li>
          <li class="py-3.5 pl-[52px] relative border-b border-border text-ink-2 guide-step"><strong>Kill losers, scale winners.</strong> Pause any variant that misses your CPA target after the testing period. Allocate remaining budget to the 2&ndash;4 winners. Scale winners until performance degrades (creative fatigue, typically 2&ndash;4 weeks).</li>
          <li class="py-3.5 pl-[52px] relative text-ink-2 guide-step"><strong>Repeat monthly.</strong> Order the next batch. Use learnings from the previous batch to refine your briefs: which hooks worked, which ad types performed, which creator styles resonated. Each batch gets better.</li>
        </ol>

        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-[20px] tracking-[-0.01em] mt-8 mb-3">The math of volume testing</h3>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-card mb-6">
