              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Variants after remix</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">20&ndash;25</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">40&ndash;50</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Production cost</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">$1,500&ndash;$2,500</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">$3,000&ndash;$5,000</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Testing ad spend</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">$1,000&ndash;$2,500</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">$2,000&ndash;$5,000</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Expected winners</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">1&ndash;3</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">3&ndash;6</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-ink">Winner lifespan</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-ink-2">2&ndash;4 weeks</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-ink-2">2&ndash;4 weeks</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">The key insight: creative fatigue means you need a continuous pipeline, not one-off production. Winning ads degrade after 2&ndash;4 weeks. Monthly whitelabel UGC production is not a nice-to-have &mdash; it's the operational requirement for sustained paid ad performance.</p>
